### Feature Employee — CREATE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### CREATE -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/empleados
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Laura Gómez",
  "descripcion": "Barista turno mañana"
}
